# Build output. The crate is also the top of its own repository now, so this has to hold in both
# places: `target/` is machine-local and never source.
target/

# `libs.sh` used to cache the loader path here; the binary resolves its own libraries now
# (`src/preload.rs`), so the file is legacy and ignored only so an old checkout stays clean.
.libs

# The golden reference frames are committed on purpose: they are the layout contract the test
# suite enforces. They are gzip-compressed PPM dumps (~40 KB and ~95 KB), which the repo-wide
# `*.gz` rule would otherwise keep out of the tree.
!golden/*.gz
